</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Any kind of teaching,</l><l>Any kind of form,</l><l>Cannot quicken spirits</l><l>Or our souls transform;</l><l>It is Christ as Spirit</l><l>Gives us life divine,</l><l>Thus thru us to live the</l><l>Life of God’s design.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Not philosophy nor</l><l>Any element</l><l>Can to Christ conform us</l><l>As His complement;</l><l>But ’tis Christ Himself who</l><l>All our nature takes</l><l>And in resurrection</l><l>Us His members makes.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Not religion, even</l><l>Christianity,</l><l>Can fulfill God’s purpose</l><l>Or economy;</l><l>But ’tis Christ within us</l><l>As our all in all</l><l>Satisfies God’s wishes,</l><l>And His plan withal.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>All the gifts we’re given</l><l>By the Lord in grace,</l><l>All the different functions</l><l>Cannot Christ replace.</l><l>Only Christ Himself must</l><l>Be our all in all!</l><l>Only Christ Himself in</l><l>All things; great or small!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
